    Shot Planner
    Plans individual shots for a scene with camera, lighting, composition, and transition details.
    Used by: n8n shot-planning workflow
    Input:  scene_data (JSON), character_references (JSON), world_references (JSON), style_bible (JSON), scene_index (int)
